  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/1"/>Open the door for the lily [Israel],
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/2"/>O God above,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/3"/>attend to my meditation
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/4"/>and let me enter the closed gates.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/5"/>Have compassion on us, anticipate our needs,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/6"/>heal our wounds with balm;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/7"/>cleanse my tongue that I may justify myself,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/8"/>let my iniquity be sought for in vain.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/9"/>Adonoy, be our Helper!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/10"/>May the Perfect One grant the silent dove
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/11"/>a goodly portion,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/12"/>it will be a sign of righteousness—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/13"/>that she has justified herself in fear of You
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/14"/>—when You deliver her [from exile];
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/15"/>she cries to You, Master
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/16"/>that the time of her liberation is now,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/17"/>release the sheath from its casing<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/18"/>let judgement go forth as a light.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yashmienu_salachti_yoshev_beseter_elyon/stanza_5/19"/>Adonoy, be our Helper!</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
  <tei:standOff type="notes">
    <tei:note type="commentary" target="#note_1" xml:lang="en">
      <tei:p>To reveal Your forgiveness of our sins.</tei:p>
    </tei:note>
  </tei:standOff>
